flowchart LR
  subgraph Data[Data and training]
    SG[Synthetic Log Generator] --> RAW[(Versioned JSONL splits)]
    RAW --> TF[Time-aware Feature Pipeline]
    TF --> IFT[Isolation Forest Training]
    TF --> RFT[Weighted Random Forest Training]
    IFT --> AR[(Model Artifact Store)]
    RFT --> AR
    AR --> CMP[Candidate Performance Gate]
    CMP -->|approved| ACTIVE[Active Model Bundle]
  end

  subgraph Runtime[Real-time inference]
    CLIENT[Stream Simulator / Log Source] --> API[FastAPI Ingestion API]
    API --> VALID[Event Parser and Validator]
    VALID --> FP[Feature Registry and Pipeline]
    PROFILES[(Behavioral Profile Store)] <--> FP
    FP --> IF[Isolation Forest]
    FP --> RF[Attack Classifier]
    IF --> RISK[Explainability and Risk Engine]
    RF --> RISK
    RISK --> DB[(Event / Prediction / Alert Store)]
    RISK --> DRIFT[Concept Drift Monitor]
    RISK --> SSE[Server-Sent Events]
    SSE --> UI[React Analyst Dashboard]
  end

  ACTIVE --> IF
  ACTIVE --> RF
  UI --> FEEDBACK[Analyst Feedback]
  FEEDBACK --> DB
  FEEDBACK --> TRUST[Trusted Adaptation Queue]
  TRUST --> PROFILES
  DRIFT --> REVIEW[Controlled Retraining Review]
  REVIEW --> TF

